; Ctrl+Alt+F8 / Fn code 6Ah: if MISER present and 40:B6 bit2 allows, unmask IRQ1, enable keyboard (AEh), EOI, pre hook, far call MISER API 30h (show_power_meter), post hook.
hotkey_power_meter:
        push ax                                  ; CBE3
        push bx                                  ; CBE4
        push cx                                  ; CBE5
        call miser_present_check                 ; CBE6
        jne loc_CC16                             ; CBE9
        call power_meter_allowed_check           ; CBEB
        jne loc_CC16                             ; CBEE
        push ax                                  ; CBF0
